Tannery 001 Use
    Events
        Unit - A unit Begins channeling an ability
    Conditions
        (Unit-type of (Casting unit)) Equal to Tannery
    Actions
        -------- Set current Cauldron "in use" --------
        Set VariableSet TanneryCurrent = (Casting unit)
        -------- --------------------- --------
        -------- Reinforced Leather Belt --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Ability being cast) Equal to LW_ReinforcedLeatherBelt 
            Then - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                    Then - Actions
                        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
                        Sound - Play Tannery <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to TanneryCurrent
                        Wait 5.00 seconds
                        Set VariableSet TanneryUnitPos = (Position of Nazgrek)
                        Item - Create |cFF90EE90Reinforced Leather Belt|r at TanneryUnitPos
                        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_TanneryUnitPos)
                        -------- Remote materials --------
                        Game - Display to (All players) the text: |cFFFFCC00Created:|...
                        Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
                        Skip remaining actions
                    Else - Actions
            Else - Actions
